 early closing time.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(99,3,13,'PART_4','MEDIUM','DEMO600:LIS-05:Q09','What should callers do to ask about a bill?','[Audio script] Thank you for calling Benson Medical Center. To schedule or change an appointment, press one. For billing questions, press two. To speak with a nurse, press three.',NULL,NULL,'The recording instructs callers with billing questions to press two.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(100,3,13,'PART_3','HARD','DEMO600:LIS-05:Q10','What problem are the speakers discussing?','[Audio script]\nWoman: The printer on the third floor is out of toner again.\nMan: I ordered two cartridges yesterday, but delivery isn\'t until Thursday.\nWoman: I\'ll use the second-floor printer for today\'s reports.',NULL,NULL,'They discuss a printer that cannot be used because it has no toner.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(101,3,14,'PART_7','EASY','DEMO600:REA-01:Q01','Why was the memo written?','To: All Staff\nFrom: Facilities Department\nSubject: Lobby renovation\nBeginning Monday, the main lobby will be closed for painting. Employees should enter through the east door until work is completed on Thursday.',NULL,NULL,'The memo announces a temporary entrance change caused by lobby renovation.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(102,3,14,'PART_7','EASY','DEMO600:REA-01:Q02','Which order qualifies for free delivery?','Marlow Office Supply\nOrder before 3 p.m. for next-business-day delivery. Orders over $75 qualify for free delivery within the city. Custom-printed products require five business days.',NULL,NULL,'The advertisement states that city orders over $75 receive free delivery.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(103,3,14,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-01:Q03','What are team members asked to do?','From: Nina Cho\nTo: Project Team\nThe client has asked us to move Thursday\'s presentation from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. Please send me your revised slides by Wednesday noon so I can combine them before the meeting.',NULL,NULL,'Nina asks team members to send revised slides by Wednesday noon.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(104,3,14,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-01:Q04','Where may employees park on May 18?','NOTICE\nThe employee parking area behind Building C will be unavailable on May 18 while new lighting is installed. Staff may use the visitor lot on Green Street at no charge that day.',NULL,NULL,'The notice directs employees to the visitor lot on Green Street.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(105,3,14,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-01:Q05','What should Ms. Lewis do first?','Dear Ms. Lewis,\nWe received your request to exchange the Model X20 headset. A replacement will be shipped as soon as the returned item reaches our warehouse. A prepaid return label is attached.\nCustomer Support',NULL,NULL,'The replacement ships after the original reaches the warehouse, and a return label is provided, so she must return the headset.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(106,3,14,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-01:Q06','Which session begins immediately after the networking break?','CITY BUSINESS FORUM\nFriday, June 12\n9:00 Opening remarks\n9:30 Digital Marketing Trends\n11:00 Networking break\n11:30 Exporting to New Markets\nAdvance registration closes June 5.',NULL,NULL,'The schedule shows Exporting to New Markets at 11:30, directly after the 11:00 break.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(107,3,14,'PART_7','HARD','DEMO600:REA-01:Q07','What is required of applicants?','Job Opening: Operations Assistant\nApplicants must have at least two years of administrative experience and be available to work occasional Saturdays. Knowledge of spreadsheet software is preferred but not required. Applications close August 8.',NULL,NULL,'Two years of administrative experience is explicitly required; spreadsheet knowledge is only preferred.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(108,3,14,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-01:Q08','Why is the express service unavailable?','The 7:15 express service to Northport will not operate this week because of track maintenance. Passengers may take the 7:05 local service and transfer at Milton, or use the temporary bus departing at 7:20.',NULL,NULL,'The notice identifies track maintenance as the reason.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(109,3,14,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-01:Q09','What is NOT included in the promotion?','Members of the Parkside Fitness Center receive 15 percent off personal training packages purchased before September 30. This offer excludes introductory packages and cannot be combined with other promotions.',NULL,NULL,'The advertisement explicitly excludes introductory packages.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(110,3,14,'PART_7','HARD','DEMO600:REA-01:Q10','What can be inferred about the order?','From: Shipping Department\nThe 120 desk lamps ordered from Vela Manufacturing arrived this morning. Six boxes were damaged, so the receiving team accepted only 108 lamps. Purchasing has contacted Vela about the missing units.',NULL,NULL,'Only 108 of 120 lamps were accepted, so twelve lamps were not accepted because of damaged boxes.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(111,3,15,'PART_7','EASY','DEMO600:REA-02:Q01','Why was the memo written?','To: All Staff\nFrom: Facilities Department\nSubject: Lobby renovation\nBeginning Monday, the main lobby will be closed for painting. Employees should enter through the east door until work is completed on Thursday.',NULL,NULL,'The memo announces a temporary entrance change caused by lobby renovation.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(112,3,15,'PART_7','EASY','DEMO600:REA-02:Q02','Which order qualifies for free delivery?','Marlow Office Supply\nOrder before 3 p.m. for next-business-day delivery. Orders over $75 qualify for free delivery within the city. Custom-printed products require five business days.',NULL,NULL,'The advertisement states that city orders over $75 receive free delivery.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(113,3,15,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-02:Q03','What are team members asked to do?','From: Nina Cho\nTo: Project Team\nThe client has asked us to move Thursday\'s presentation from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. Please send me your revised slides by Wednesday noon so I can combine them before the meeting.',NULL,NULL,'Nina asks team members to send revised slides by Wednesday noon.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(114,3,15,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-02:Q04','Where may employees park on May 18?','NOTICE\nThe employee parking area behind Building C will be unavailable on May 18 while new lighting is installed. Staff may use the visitor lot on Green Street at no charge that day.',NULL,NULL,'The notice directs employees to the visitor lot on Green Street.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(115,3,15,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-02:Q05','What should Ms. Lewis do first?','Dear Ms. Lewis,\nWe received your request to exchange the Model X20 headset. A replacement will be shipped as soon as the returned item reaches our warehouse. A prepaid return label is attached.\nCustomer Support',NULL,NULL,'The replacement ships after the original reaches the warehouse, and a return label is provided, so she must return the headset.',1.00,'ACTIVE','2026-09-25 00:09:24','2026-09-25 00:09:24'),(116,3,15,'PART_7','MEDIUM','DEMO600:REA-02:Q06','Which session begins immediately after the networking break?','CITY BUSINESS FORUM\nFriday, June 12\n9:00 Opening remarks\n9:30 Digital Marketing Trends\n11:00 Networking break\n11:30 Exporting to New Markets\nAdvance registration closes June 5.',NULL,NULL,'The schedule shows Exporting to New Markets at 11