INSERT INTO test_bank_reading_items(created_by_teacher_id,title,instruction,passage,passage_format,toeic_part,passage_type,status) VALUES (3,'Test: Notice — Hotel Check-in Policy Update','Read the notice and answer the questions.','## Sunrise Bay Hotel — Notice to Guests

Effective **March 1**, the check-in time at Sunrise Bay Hotel will change from 2:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m. Check-out remains at 11:00 a.m.

Guests who arrive before check-in time may leave their luggage with the front desk free of charge. Early check-in is available for a fee of twenty dollars, subject to room availability.

Members of the Bay Rewards program are exempt from the early check-in fee. To join, please visit the front desk or register online at least one day before your arrival.','MARKDOWN','PART_7','SINGLE','ACTIVE');
