INSERT INTO test_bank_reading_items(created_by_teacher_id,title,instruction,passage,passage_format,toeic_part,passage_type,status) VALUES (3,'Test: Part 6 — Memo on a Software Update','Read the memo and choose the best word or phrase for each blank.','**To:** All Employees
**From:** IT Department
**Subject:** Scheduled system update

Please be informed that the company''s accounting software will be updated this Saturday from 10:00 p.m. to 2:00 a.m. During this period, the system (1) ______ unavailable. We recommend that you save and close all open files before leaving the office on Friday.

The new version includes a faster reporting tool and an improved search function. Training sessions will be held next week (2) ______ employees in the Finance Department. All other staff members can watch a short video tutorial on the intranet.

If you experience any problems after the update, (3) ______ the help desk at extension 220.','MARKDOWN','PART_6','SINGLE','ACTIVE');
SET @i=LAST_INSERT_ID();
