INSERT INTO test_bank_reading_items(created_by_teacher_id,title,instruction,passage,passage_format,toeic_part,passage_type,status) VALUES (3,'Test: Online Review — Harbor Café','Read the online review and answer the questions.','**Harbor Café — 4 out of 5 stars**
*Reviewed by Tom Bradley, March 12*

I visited Harbor Café last Saturday with two colleagues after a client meeting. The café is located right next to the ferry terminal, so it is very easy to find. We ordered the daily lunch special, which included a bowl of vegetable soup and a sandwich for only eight dollars.

The food was excellent and arrived quickly. However, the service was a little slow when we asked for the bill, probably because the place was crowded. I would also suggest that the owners add more outlets for laptops, since several customers were working there.

Overall, I will definitely return and recommend it to anyone who works nearby.','MARKDOWN','PART_7','SINGLE','ACTIVE');
SET @i=LAST_INSERT_ID();
